WEBVTT

00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:08.734
<v><b>Justin:</b></v> You’re thinking of taking a vacation or traveling somewhere nice,

00:00:08.868 --> 00:00:12.622
but there are so many different ways of traveling,

00:00:12.646 --> 00:00:15.047
and thousands of places to go.

00:00:15.734 --> 00:00:17.009
Where do you start?

00:00:17.831 --> 00:00:23.970
Why not follow these three simple steps to find the right vacation for you?

00:00:24.934 --> 00:00:30.584
Step one. Think about what you want to do on your vacation.

00:00:31.543 --> 00:00:37.512
The first thing people usually try to decide is where they want to go,

00:00:38.146 --> 00:00:43.480
but it’s probably better to start by thinking about what you want to do.

00:00:44.366 --> 00:00:46.081
Do you want to relax?

00:00:46.674 --> 00:00:49.078
Then think about how you relax.

00:00:49.498 --> 00:00:53.341
For example, do you like reading or doing yoga,

00:00:53.541 --> 00:00:56.247
or do you like doing something more active?

00:00:57.708 --> 00:01:00.570
Do you want to visit an exciting new city,

00:01:00.703 --> 00:01:04.655
or see some scenery and animals that are different from where you live?

00:01:05.528 --> 00:01:07.723
Seeing something completely new is

00:01:07.724 --> 00:01:11.182
a great way to forget about your normal life.

00:01:12.832 --> 00:01:15.099
Do you want to go on an adventure?

00:01:15.763 --> 00:01:18.790
Perhaps you’re dreaming about climbing Mount Fuji

00:01:18.924 --> 00:01:21.774
or living in Kenya with the Maasai people.

00:01:22.699 --> 00:01:27.368
You could use your vacation to make one of those dreams come true.

00:01:28.645 --> 00:01:30.805
Do you want to learn something new?

00:01:31.648 --> 00:01:36.020
Not everybody wants to sit in a classroom learning a new language

00:01:36.027 --> 00:01:39.882
or be in a kitchen learning to cook when they’re on vacation,

00:01:40.121 --> 00:01:41.801
but some people love it.

00:01:42.521 --> 00:01:46.411
And nowadays you can take courses in many countries

00:01:46.412 --> 00:01:50.514
and experience a different culture at the same time.

00:01:51.938 --> 00:01:53.891
So now, step two.

00:01:54.764 --> 00:01:58.034
Think about the people you’re going to go with.

00:01:58.747 --> 00:02:01.102
Are they family or friends?

00:02:01.815 --> 00:02:03.332
Do they have children?

00:02:04.086 --> 00:02:05.974
What do they want to do?

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:10.166
People have different needs and interests,

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.134
and if you’re all going to enjoy the vacation,

00:02:13.438 --> 00:02:17.348
you need to make sure you all want the same things.

00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:22.349
But if what you really want to do is to meet new people,

00:02:22.749 --> 00:02:25.735
maybe it would be better to travel alone.

00:02:26.963 --> 00:02:29.471
And finally, step three.

00:02:30.169 --> 00:02:34.144
Think about good vacations you had in the past.

00:02:34.921 --> 00:02:36.309
Why were they good?

00:02:36.867 --> 00:02:39.693
Maybe it was the people you were with.

00:02:40.335 --> 00:02:44.676
Maybe it was something you learned, or an experience you had.

00:02:45.511 --> 00:02:48.508
What can you repeat from those vacations?

00:02:49.789 --> 00:02:54.268
Of course, there are always other things you need to consider,

00:02:54.503 --> 00:02:56.836
like how much money you can spend,

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.318
and how much time you can be away.

00:02:59.964 --> 00:03:03.663
But, first, follow these three steps,

00:03:03.843 --> 00:03:08.635
and then you’re ready to start thinking about where you want to go!